<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20463] ldlm: fix missing unlock_res_and_lock() in ldlm_process_flock_lock() error path</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20463</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;In `ldlm_process_flock_lock()`, when a lock split is required during a partial&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;unlock operation and `ldlm_lock_create()` fails, the code returns without&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;calling `unlock_res_and_lock(req)`. This leaves the resource lock held&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;indefinitely, causing a server deadlock.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment />
        <key id="98405">LU-20463</key>
            <summary>ldlm: fix missing unlock_res_and_lock() in ldlm_process_flock_lock() error path</summary>
